This licence covers the pipeline code in this repository. It does not cover
the software it runs on, which carries its own terms:

  Kokoro-82M          Apache-2.0   https://huggingface.co/hexgrad/Kokoro-82M
  kokoro (library)    Apache-2.0   https://github.com/hexgrad/kokoro
  misaki (G2P)        Apache-2.0   https://github.com/hexgrad/misaki
  espeak-ng           GPL-3.0      https://github.com/espeak-ng/espeak-ng
  phonemizer-fork     GPL-3.0      https://github.com/bootphon/phonemizer
  ffmpeg              LGPL/GPL     https://ffmpeg.org

espeak-ng and phonemizer are GPL-3.0 and Kokoro cannot phonemize English
without them. They are installed separately by the user and are not
distributed as part of this repository, which is why this code can be MIT
licensed. If you intend to redistribute a bundle that includes them, take
your own legal advice.

Nothing here grants any rights in the books you feed it. Converting a book
you own for your own listening is one thing; distributing the result is
another, and copyright in the text is unaffected by having narrated it.
